  "answer": "**Production usage:** only in the locale root layout.\n\n### Mounted in `app/[locale]/layout.tsx`\n\nImported at line 41 and rendered in `<head>` (after `TBAnalyticsStubScript`) at lines 219–227:\n\n```219:227:app/[locale]/layout.tsx\n        <GlobalScriptsSDK\n          config={{\n            brand,\n            locale,\n            page,\n            runtimeConfig,\n            debug: env.GLOBAL_SCRIPTS_DEBUG,\n          }}\n        />\n```\n\nThat layout wraps all `[locale]` routes, so `GlobalScriptsSDK` runs app-wide for those pages.\n\n### Tests\n\n`app/components/GlobalScripts/__tests__/GlobalScriptsSDK.test.tsx` imports and renders it directly (line 3, and many `render(<GlobalScriptsSDK …>)` calls).\n\n### Mentions only (not imported/rendered)\n\nComments in `AnalyticsLifecycleTracker.tsx`, its test, `tracking.ts`, `searchGTMevents.ts`, `usePdpCapiViewContent.ts`, and `lib/config/publicConfig.ts` refer to it for analytics ownership / contracts — they do not mount the component.",
